<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bear Stearns start gas cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bear Stearns start gas cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns initiated coverage of some gas and oil exploration, development and production companies, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Bear Stearns initiated coverage of Union Pacific Resources Group Inc as a buy, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- initiated coverage of National Energy Group Inc and Barrett Resources Corp as attractive, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
